<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
We want your journey with us to be seamless from start to finish, so I’m sorry to learn about your concerns regarding announcements on departure from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Enhancing our lounge experience</strong><br />
<br />
We believe our lounges should be a tranquil place to relax prior to your flight.<br />
<br />
Customer feedback told us that we were making too many announcements in the lounge, so we reduced the number of boarding calls to one first and one final call for each flight.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to clear communication</strong><br />
<br />
We understand how important clear and timely communication is while making your way through the terminal and apologise for any &lt;confusion/delays&gt; this caused you..<br />
<br />
Boarding times are printed on each customer’s boarding pass and are displayed on departure boards throughout the terminal and our lounges, so customers can plan their walk to the gate in time for boarding commencement.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that I’ve passed your comments on to the relevant team so we can work to improve this aspect of our service in future.<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting us and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.<br />
&nbsp;</body>
</html>